Hi {Owner},

I build booking sites for pressure washing and soft wash companies around {City}. {Business Name} has great before-and-afters on social, but no site where someone can see a price and book a wash.

Instead of asking for a call first, I built a sample: an instant quote by surface and size, online booking, a soft wash versus pressure washing page, a plants and pets page, and a wash plan sign-up, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, plus {Care Range} a month for hosting and price edits. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes on the phone this week?

{Your Name}
{Your Studio} · {Your Phone}
{Your Physical Address}

Reply "stop" and I won't contact you again.
